{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "83d63fd2cd8b3b502af190d3dbdcdc41d07131126d46bd47a394d44124d47587", "ja": "エミリー、お疲れ様。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "艾米莉，辛苦了。\n新衣服感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "a9ab53932f8bb2751715fe97b8e670849a47d191112cc1f049d281952ac8776e", "ja": "仕掛け人さま！\nいつもよりなんだか大人っぽくて素敵です♪", "zh": "制作人先生！\n感觉比平时更加成熟，真是漂亮♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "11083a26476780ad22dde0642178e28bf5de5ca85e6baf7743c5142c85709ca8", "ja": "この素晴らしい衣装をより引き立てるために、\n髪型を変えてみました！　あの……いかがでしょうか？", "zh": "为了更好地衬托这套华丽的服装，我试着换了个发型！那个……您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b2a24e088370c4bc44ea0d4fc3aadddc30c22327f1a0eeaff8bda6ed16fdc399", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\n衣装にピッタリで、大人の女性って感じだな！", "zh": "啊，很适合你。\n和这套服装特别搭，感觉就是成熟的女性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "63e635439127045db4a19b58ebb23a383859fd31e6fdc489d22bc2b646a008fc", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　今回の衣装は、\n『大人の女性』を意識して作られたと聞きました。", "zh": "谢谢您♪我听说这套服装，\n是在制作时融入了“成熟女性”的概念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "cfefa559db3cf61e96c6cc612895a5481168e8f85c00a1eecb2161b9e64b3799", "ja": "なので、小さな女の子が憧れるような女性を、\n衣装だけでなく、全身で表現できたらと思って。", "zh": "所以，我想通过全身的表现，而不仅仅是服装，成为让小女孩憧憬的女性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d9441198e8b861049868e372288edc99ab45fbe431d4b9977b437a15b4f9730b", "ja": "そういうことなら、大成功だ。\n育や桃子に見せたら、喜びそうだ！", "zh": "既然是这样，那就大获成功了。\n要是给育和桃子看，她们肯定会很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "12e9eb4cb39d6eef09819625f4a4a87de7edc61acb355b50ff7a60b3549076a8", "ja": "ふうっ、そう言っていただけてよかったです。\n何かに憧れる気持ちは、私もよくわかりますから……。", "zh": "呼……您能这么说，真是太好了。\n憧憬着某样东西的心情，我也很能理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "59cb7c0a5182286bfb6e05faba410a8a6d3e7d3357651a1c0bee74f389d72705", "ja": "エミリー……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "cc2a258d5c047a2222b8b7356965ae962ab2a9ea63ba43e405c6a409dc97f66e", "ja": "初めて大和撫子を見た時は、とても感動しました。\nその気持ちは、今でも覚えています！", "zh": "第一次见到大和抚子时，我非常感动。\n那份心情，我至今仍然记得！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "3360e6895693777ba71c131007963d40437e14dbce959e5c369f7e7c9d09a550", "ja": "あの時の憧れがあったから……私は、今ここにいる。\nなんとも不思議なめぐり合わせですね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "正因为当时的那份憧憬……我现在才会站在这里。\n真是不可思议的奇妙机缘呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b370a4ffec65eb0ee2041b278d94f43f104ed404d1062278b58bb7049cba89d3", "ja": "ああ。一度きりのステージが人生を変えることもある。\n今のエミリーをみて、憧れる子もいるかもしれないな。", "zh": "啊。仅有一次的舞台，也可能改变人生。\n看到现在的艾米莉，说不定也会有憧憬她的孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "3e7a12d6b7b08a4365b52156fb2fbe697b2f0327deabd960a2ed2b05923c79b6", "ja": "まあ！　本当にそうなったら嬉しいですね♪\nあっ、でも私はまだ未熟者ですし……。", "zh": "哎呀！要是真的能那样，我也会很高兴呢♪\n啊，不过我现在还很不成熟……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7cae7fc21ec9446e1a509655d5ddd1de407ba898c321247c204438b056e0c4f6", "ja": "憧れる存在が未熟かなんて関係ないんじゃないかな。\n好きな気持ちは止められないんだからね。", "zh": "憧憬的对象是否还不成熟，应该没什么关系吧。\n毕竟喜欢的心情是无法抑制的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1015_p", "source_sha256": "02779a1416b666c2a2a62451d88a5fd552df20c938e7b6ff9a85710295874839", "ja": "それにこの衣装が、きっと自信をくれるはずだ。\nステージ上で、女の子達の憧れの的になってほしい。", "zh": "而且，这套服装一定能给你带来自信。\n希望你能在舞台上成为女孩子们憧憬的对象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "155371bc296c4a3eebd2321c3041406e5f7f47a49442ef1f9c08db918b3731bc", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。\nあたたかい言葉、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "制作人……。\n谢谢您温暖的话语♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0324_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "5b9b1559f89aea73e7482c9bd24a3da55fa7d6516a8bf8b1767ff99106d2f393", "ja": "小さなごヒイキ様にも楽しんでいただけるように……\nいつもより、少しだけ背伸びした私をお見せしますね♪", "zh": "为了让年幼的支持者也能享受其中……  \n我会展现比平时稍微成熟一点的自己给您看哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
